   281	### 2.3 Theorem FM [proved]
   282	
   283	**Statement.**
   284	- Fix odd d ≥ 3, k > (d+1)/4, a > 0, σ > 0 and η₀ > 0, and let h ≥ max(1/(4k), s − (d−2)/(4k)) + η₀.
   285	- Then for all large N (preprocessed), with an implied constant depending only on (d, k, a, σ, h, η₀):
   286	    E_{ℓ∈J, A∼𝒜} N_ℓ(A) ≥ S²ρ_rρ_F/(log N)^{O(1)}.
   287	
   288	*Proof.* Write Pr_A for g uniform on 𝒢 and c uniform on C_H, independently. Then
